# "Target creature you don't control": Bot1's own Elvish Mystic is refused (named in the refusal), Bot2's is exiled. Bot2 then
# searches for a basic land: a Volcanic Island is not one (refusal), a Forest is, and it enters tapped.

[Bot1 Deck]
Plains
Mox Emerald
Mox Jet
Elvish Mystic
Winds of Abandon
Plains x12

[Bot2 Deck]
Forest
Elvish Mystic
Forest x5
Forest
Volcanic Island
Forest x8

[Actions]
Bot1.Hand.Mox Emerald.Cast
Bot1.Hand.Mox Jet.Cast
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Emerald.Activate
Bot1.Hand.Elvish Mystic.Cast
[T2 Bot2.Main1]
Bot2.Hand.Forest.Play
Bot2.Battlefield.Forest.Activate
Bot2.Hand.Elvish Mystic.Cast
[T3 Bot1.Main1]
Bot1.Hand.Plains.Play
Bot1.Battlefield.Plains.Activate
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Jet.Activate
! Bot1.Hand.Winds of Abandon.Cast(Bot1.Battlefield.Elvish Mystic)
Bot1.Hand.Winds of Abandon.Cast(Bot2.Battlefield.Elvish Mystic)
! Bot2.Search(Volcanic Island)
Bot2.Search(Forest)
[T3 Bot1.Main2]

[Expect]
Exile = Elvish Mystic
Bot1.Battlefield.Elvish Mystic.Power = 1
Bot2.Battlefield = Forest; Forest
Bot2.Battlefield.Forest#2.Tapped = true
